---
/**
 * Privacy notice. Owner decisions (2026-11-25): inquiry emails kept 24
 * months; privacy contact privacy@bontilebiz.com; reviewed by the owner
 * (no external legal review). Facts checked against worker/contact.ts,
 * wrangler.jsonc and docs/decisions/EMAIL_CONFIGURATION.md.
 * Staged page (preview-only).
 */
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/common/PageHeader.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';

const privacyEmail = 'privacy@bontilebiz.com';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy notice" description="How information sent through this site is collected, used and kept.">
  <PageHeader title="Privacy notice" draft>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-(--container-prose) text-muted">Last updated: 25 November 2026</p>
  </PageHeader>

  <Section tone="white">
    <div class="privacy max-w-(--container-prose)">
      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        Jonathan Bontile, CPA, of Bontile Bookkeeping Services in the Philippines, is responsible for information sent
        through this website. For privacy questions or requests, write to <a href={`mailto:${privacyEmail}`}>{privacyEmail}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>When you use the contact form:</strong> your name, email address, inquiry type and message, plus your company
        and subject if you add them.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>When you send the form:</strong> your IP address is used to limit repeated submissions and is passed to
        Cloudflare Turnstile for the spam check. This site doesn't store it.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>When you visit:</strong> page visits are counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which gives aggregated
        statistics without cookies and without tracking you across sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Why it is used</h2>
      <p>
        Your details are used only to reply to your inquiry and, if you go ahead, to discuss the work or role. They are never
        sold, shared for marketing or added to a mailing list.
      </p>
      <p>
        They are processed because you asked for a reply, which is a step taken at your request before any engagement, and
        because replying to inquiries is a legitimate interest of the business. This applies under the Philippine Data Privacy
        Act of 2012 and, for visitors in the EU or UK, under the GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> hosting, security, the spam check (Turnstile) and visit statistics. Cloudflare keeps
          short-lived technical logs of form requests, without the message content.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Resend:</strong> delivers the form's emails. It keeps message content and delivery logs for 30 days.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Google Workspace:</strong> the inbox where inquiries are received and kept.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>International transfers</h2>
      <p>
        These providers may process your information outside your country, including in the United States and Japan. Each
        provides contractual safeguards for international transfers.
      </p>

      <h2>How long it is kept</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiry emails are kept for 24 months after the last message in the conversation and then deleted. If the inquiry
        leads to work, the records needed for that engagement are kept as long as the engagement and the law require. The
        website itself doesn't store form submissions.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no tracking or advertising cookies. The spam check on the contact form may use strictly necessary
        signals to tell people from automated programs.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to be informed about, access, correct, delete or block the information you sent, receive a copy of it, or
        object to how it's used. Write to <a href={`mailto:${privacyEmail}`}>{privacyEmail}</a>; you'll get a reply within 30
        days. You can also complain to the National Privacy Commission of the Philippines or to the data protection authority
        where you live.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        Information is sent over encrypted connections, access to the inbox is restricted,
        and the site doesn't keep a copy of your message. If a breach affects your information, you'll be told as the law
        requires.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is for businesses and employers and isn't intended for children.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this notice changes, the date at the top changes too.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .privacy :global(h2) {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    line-height: var(--text-h3--line-height);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .privacy :global(h2:first-child) {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .privacy :global(p),
  .privacy :global(ul) {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy :global(ul) {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .privacy :global(li + li) {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
